nce is clearly missed, feel free to be funny with it and keep it lighthearted. Do not mock the user or advertiser; keep the humor gentle.\\n\\nKeep it concise, direct, and easy to scan.\\n\\n{conversation}\",\"enable_web_search\":false},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1025202184\":{\"name\":\"1025202184\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":10,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"elevated_risk_url\":\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001062-elevated-risk-labels\",\"sensitive_actions_url\":\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/11487775-apps-in-chatgpt#important-actions\",\"context_sharing_url\":\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/11487775-apps-in-chatgpt#what-does-chatgpt-share-with-apps\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"2558204672\":{\"name\":\"2558204672\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":24,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"check_max_workspace_redemption_count\":true,\"check_fraudulent_organization\":true,\"per_eligible_invite_credit_amount_usd\":100,\"check_paid_business_seat\":true,\"check_workspace_business_free_trial\":true,\"max_total_num_credits\":12500,\"terms_url\":\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001150\",\"max_total_credit_amount_usd\":500,\"offer_text\":\"Get {amount} in credits for every member who starts using Codex.\",\"check_professional_workspace_owner_domain\":true,\"check_workspace_owner\":true,\"run_grant_sentinel_check\":true,\"exclude_usage_based_seats_from_paid_business_seat_check\":true,\"fine_print_text\":\"{amount} credit eligibility requires that the user be added as a Codex PAYG seat to a verified-domain organization and have used Codex on or before April 30, not have had a paid business seat within 90 days, not have redeemed the promotion before, not have been associated with a fraudulent organization, and be in a workspace with a total cap of no more than {maxAmount}.\",\"per_eligible_invite_num_credits\":2500,\"terms_text\":\"View Term